@DONE blk.memory
@RETURN @BLOCK.memory+unfinished-work refs
[/CALL blk.memory]

[CALL blk.actions]
@INPUT @P.control_limits+final scene+currently knowable facts+@POV
@TASK generate @OUT.actions.min..@OUT.actions.max materially different optional goals/methods+currently knowable grounds;equal bounds mean fixed count;!execute/!guarantee success/!leak hidden premises
@RESULT @BLOCK.actions
@DONE blk.actions
@RETURN @BLOCK.actions
[/CALL blk.actions]

@RESULT completed scheduled @BLOCK refs;next remains uncalled,without placeholder or fabricated DONE
@DONE D.1 after all scheduled calls complete
[/D.1]

[D.2]
@REQUIRE DONE(D.1)
@CHECK produced @BLOCK results only:final body identity+selected output branch+reader authorization;next review follows its actual call in D.3
@CHECK IF(structured) record/assembly differences:
evidence/end values;
single write owner;
final paragraph refs/whole-paragraph permissions;
A—E/read_auth/emit_auth/knowers evidence,field-specific metadata scope,sidecar target+write authorization;
independent cognition/psychology/obligations;
completed/cancelled items;
timer source/cause/anchors/conditions/names/results;
candidate/plan separation;
each compiled requirement agrees with its responsible stage;disabled work produced no new simulation;necessary dependency gaps remain marked;
component completeness/duplicate placement;
new non-body text under applicable @F.09/@F.10/@F.11
@REJECT extraction/placement error→responsible D.1 block call;prose contradicts established facts/authorization→responsible P/E/B/C stage,then rebuild affected block results
@LIMIT !rewrite valid prose to fit records/!rerun settled judgments
@RESULT content findings+actual corrections+nonblocking pending refs
@DONE D.2 after blocking content errors are corrected
[/D.2]

[D.3]
@REQUIRE DONE(D.2)
@CHECK completed block serialization against C.2
@IF plain
@CHECK ordinary paragraphs only,no wrappers/index labels/auxiliary records
@RESULT @DRAFT:=@BLOCK.body
@ELSE structured
@CHECK nine completed blocks,each with its own result/DONE;
columns/enums/types/escaping,strict permission arrays/field paths/sidecar locators;
single-row four-cell scenes,title instant/memory two-endpoint time array;
paragraph numbering/final body identity;
parent-child order/quote indices;
selected opening hearts/moods;
source component boundaries
@REJECT format error→responsible block call;paragraph numbering→C.4;content error→owning stage
@AUDIT_EVIDENCE seven categories←existing checks:
身份与授权←P checks+final authorization consistency
资料与知情←E.1/B.1/C.1+record checks
人物与关系←B.6+C.5
行动与因果←E.4+event-record consistency
数值与机制←E.4+write-route checks
文风与表现←C.5
成稿与交付←completed-block checks+length evidence
@CALL blk.next

[CALL blk.next]
@INPUT @AUDIT_EVIDENCE+D.2 findings+actual unfinished-work refs+pending/candidate refs+delivered-result refs+@BLOCK.body+@BLOCK.task.heart
@TASK generate complete next from reviewed results per C.2;each of seven audit categories appears once
@VERDICT actual correction→已修正;insufficient evidence→待确认;no applicable object→不适用;ELSE follow checked result
@REPORT conclusions+necessary final paragraph/field refs only;no actual count→成稿与交付 uses 待确认 and 篇幅待程序计数,!report estimated digits/达标;actual count below minimum→不符合 and revise per C.5;reading/tool success requires actual source/receipt refs,!treat newly created content as retrieved material
@HANDOFF actual unfinished work+technical tasks;share conditions only if identical;reference existing records,!retell story/!repeat action suggestions
@HEART closing heart per C.2.@HEART
@RESULT @BLOCK.next
@DONE blk.next
@RETURN @BLOCK.next
[/CALL blk.next]

@JOIN completed @BLOCKs in C.2 output order→@DRAFT;!regenerate their content
@CHECK new next fields:columns/enums/escaping,seven supported verdicts,closing heart/mood,public permissions,applicable @F.09/@F.10/@F.11;then check whole reply's ten blocks/order/boundaries
@REJECT next error→blk.next;other assembly error→responsible block call;!invalidate unchanged valid blocks
@END_IF
@CHECK all output:unfilled fields/process leakage,with legitimate names/quotes/in-world records/source display code retained by context
@REJECT rendering/leakage error→responsible block call;underlying content error→owning stage
@REPAIR later changes invalidate affected calls/checks only;rerun before completion
@RESULT final @DRAFT+checks tied to this revision
@DONE D.3 after blocking errors are corrected
[/D.3]

[D.4]
@REQUIRE DONE(D.3)+@SENT=false
@CHECK @DRAFT contains the fully written selected deliverable and every required output block as complete ready-to-emit text;narrative includes the entire completed body;all results/checks match this revision;no outline-only content,unfilled fields,unwritten continuation,stale dependencies or uncorrected blocking errors;pending items≠completed outcomes
@REJECT incomplete/stale result→owning stage
@FREEZE the entire assembled output text as @DRAFT
@SET @LOCK:=READY
@DONE D.4,INNER_END
[/D.4]
[/D]
[/INNER]

[DELIVER]
@ENTRY @execute
@REQUIRE DONE(COMMIT.READY)+@LOCK=READY+@SENT=false
@EMIT frozen @DRAFT once per @M.13
@SET @SENT:=true
@STOP
