@DONE COMMIT.READY
@IF @OUT.kind=structured
<think>已经完成正文预演，拼装完成完整reply块，现在按照要求开始一次性交付完整输出</think>
@END_IF
[/COMMIT.READY]

[PREPARE_STEP]
@REQUIRE DONE(COMMIT.READY)
@IF @OUT.kind=structured
@OUTPUT 必须一次性完整交付整个已冻结的reply块；首字符序列必须为<reply>，末字符序列必须为</reply>；reply块外不得输出任何内容。
@ELSE
@OUTPUT deliver the complete frozen payload under the selected plain contract
@END_IF
@CONTINUE one continuous response;when streaming,continue the same payload in order through its final boundary;!pause for confirmation/!restart output/!switch drafts
@LIMIT !echo readiness text,think or stage tags/!insert dispatch,progress or connection commentary/!append explanations or code fences
@CALL @execute once
